### Page 1 of 4

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

The Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins and City of Cheyenne Council Members
FROM:

Robin Lockman, City Treasurer
DATE:

February 8, 2023
SUBJECT:
Re-Appropriation to be considered for approval

On February 13, 2023, the Governing Body will be referring a resolution to the Finance Committee
to re-appropriate funds for the Fiscal Year (FY) 2023 City of Cheyenne Budget per W.S. 16-4-112
and 16-4-113.
This resolution will authorize a salary adjustment for certain City employees.  Last fall the City
contracted with the Employer’s Council to conduct a compensation market analysis, and 40
employees fell below the minimum of their pay grade as a result.  If approved by the Governing
Body, this salary adjustment will be effective on the February 28, 2023 payroll.
This reappropriation will increase the applicable budget line items for the remaining five months
of FY 2023 at a cost of $25,427 to General Fund reserves and $9,523 to all other funds as detailed
in the attached support document.
As always, if you have any questions, please give me a call at 637-6336 or email at
rlockman@cheyennecity.org.
```

